 county&rsquo;s 4 grids. On that middle, February to March came in under 90% of normal in 34 years, the most of any pair. The last full year was uneven there: 138% of normal in Feb-Mar 2025 and 47% in Sep-Oct 2025. Grid 28668 had its driest year in 1958 at 65%, and its preliminary estimate for July to August 2026 sits at 74.7.</p>"}
